@startuml activities
' SplitSmart - Expense submission and review activity (reconciled candidate)
' Sources: design.md sections 4, 5, 8.2, 15.1-15.2; contracts/ui-workflows.md U10-U12.
title SplitSmart - Expense Submission and Review

skinparam shadowing false

|Submitter|
start
:Open "New expense" in a group;
:Enter amount, date, description,\npayer, participants, split method;
if (PERCENTAGE?) then (yes)
  :Enter a percentage per participant;
endif
:Server preview of shares (optional);
:Submit (Idempotency-Key);
|System|
if (Active member of group?) then (no)
  :404 NOT_FOUND;
  stop
endif
if (All fields valid?) then (no)
  :400 VALIDATION_FAILED\nwith every field error;
  |Submitter|
  :Correct input;
  stop
endif
|System|
:Allocate by largest remainder\n(sum of shares == amount);
:Save expense as PENDING + shares;
:Notify other active members;
:Audit EXPENSE_SUBMITTED;
note right: Balances unchanged
if (Submitter is the only manager\nand self-approval is off?) then (yes)
  :Flag reviewBlocked;\nshow guidance;
endif
|Reviewer|
:Open pending expense (version v);
:Choose Approve or Reject;
|System|
:Lock group row;
if (ReviewPolicy allows?) then (no)
  :403 FORBIDDEN_ROLE /\nSELF_APPROVAL_NOT_ALLOWED;
  stop
endif
if (Still PENDING with version v?) then (no)
  :409 EXPENSE_NOT_PENDING /\nCONCURRENT_MODIFICATION;
  |Reviewer|
  :Reload and review again;
  stop
endif
|System|
if (Decision?) then (approve)
  :status = APPROVED;
  :Included in balances from next read;
else (reject)
  :status = REJECTED + reason;
  :Never included in balances;
endif
:Record ReviewDecision;
:Notify submitter, payer, participants;
:Audit decision;
stop
@enduml
